Probability: `0.8 * 0.7 * 0.9 * 1.0 * 0.6 * 1.0 * 0.3 * 1.0 = 0.12096`

The overall probability of the sentence "The cat sees it" would be the sum of probabilities of all valid parse trees. In this simplified example, assuming only one valid parse.

