    subgraph MAC Address (48 bits / 6 Octets)
        A[Octet 1] --- B[Octet 2] --- C[Octet 3] --- D[Octet 4] --- E[Octet 5] --- F[Octet 6]
    end

    subgraph Manufacturer ID (OUI - First 24 bits)
        A -- Part of --> OUI(Organizational Unique Identifier)
        B -- Part of --> OUI
