</p>

## Relationship with Classes and Other Interfaces
*   A **class** can **extend** another class [GFG].
*   An **interface** can **extend** another interface [GFG].
*   A **class** can **implement** an interface [GFG].
*   An **interface** cannot implement a class [GFG].

