2.  $Dx + y = \sin t, \quad x + Dy = \cos t$
3.  $\frac{dx}{dt} = 3x + 2y, \quad \frac{dy}{dt} + 5x = 3y$
4.  $(D-1)x + (D+1)y = 0, \quad (D+1)x + (D-1)y = t$
5.  $\frac{d^2x}{dt^2} + y = 0, \quad \frac{d^2y}{dt^2} - x = 0$
6.  $\frac{dx}{dt} + 2y = -\sin t, \quad \frac{dy}{dt} - 2x = \cos t$
7.  $2\frac{dx}{dt} = x + 4y, \quad 2\frac{dy}{dt} = x - 2y$

