2.  Subtrahend `B = 0101` (4-bit representation of +5)
3.  Find 1''s complement of `B = 0101`: `1010`
4.  Add `A` to 1''s complement of `B`:
    ```
      0010 (+2)
    + 1010 (-5 in 1''s complement)
    --------
      1100
